bullet - Adds physics from sci-physics/bullet
cod - Adds support for Call of Duty 1 assets
ezhud - Adds EZQuake HUD
ffmpeg - Adds support for more media types
hl2 - Adds support for Half-Life 2 assets
irc - Adds an IRC client
models - Adds models format plugin, but it's slightly redundant due to gltf2 support
mpq - Adds support for Mo'PaQ archives used by Blizzard games
ode - Adds rigid body physics from dev-games/ode
openssl - Adds OpenSSL support
qi - Adds a QuakeC interpreter plugin
quake3 - Adds support for Quake 3 assets
terraingen - Adds a terrain generation plugin
xmpp - Adds a Jabber/XMPP client
